    "name": {
      "zh": "Sega Mega Drive",
      "en": "Sega Mega Drive (Genesis)"
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1988,
    "manufacturer": "Sega",
    "category": "game-console",
    "description": "1988 年世嘉推出的 16 位家用游戏机，以 Motorola 68000 与 Z80 双 CPU 及 Yamaha FM 音源定义了街机味家用机的硬件范式。",
    "authors": [
      {
        "name": "箱庭电子博物馆项目组",
        "role": "author"
      }
    ],
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Mega Drive（北美名 Genesis）是世嘉于 1988 年推出的 16 位家用游戏机，是第四世代主机的开篇之作。它以 Motorola 68000 主处理器与 Zilog Z80 副处理器的双 CPU 分工、Yamaha YM2612 FM 音源，把街机厅的声画体验搬进客厅，靠《索尼克》系列与任天堂展开了著名的主机战争，全球销量约 3075 万台。",
      "en": "The Mega Drive (Genesis in North America) is a 16-bit home console released by Sega in 1988, the opening shot of the fourth generation. Built around a dual-CPU design (Motorola 68000 main + Zilog Z80 sound co-processor) and the Yamaha YM2612 FM chip, it brought arcade audiovisual power home and waged the famous console war against Nintendo, selling about 30.75 million units."
    },
    "sources": [
      {
        "type": "documentation",
        "title": "Wikipedia: Sega Genesis / Mega Drive",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sega_Genesis",
